# Supported Models: deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017 | qwen3.8-flash-next | qwen3.8-27b | glm-5.3-flash
#
# ZERO-CONFIG DETERMINISTIC TWIN NOTE:
# Leaving VULTR_INFERENCE_API_KEY blank automatically engages the Deterministic
